{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.113.222.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79576,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a8011619dec28bb6edb07642d48fc6b","RawContent":"I can tell you the airlines usually don&#039;t waive the fees. If you can take your bags as carrying on&#039;s then you can check it at the gate for free. Or see if the resorts take fed ex packages. I can tell you don&#039;t check your dress or any decorations just in case. I hope this helps if you have more questions I will be glad to help.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904563,"PostDate":1442032631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I can tell you the airlines usually don't waive the fees. If you can take your bags as carrying on's then you can check it at the gate for free. Or see if the resorts take fed ex packages. I can tell you don't check your dress or any decorations just in case. I hope this helps if you have more questions I will be glad to help.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440298010,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name