Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":596,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1902978,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1440079286,"LastPoster":{"Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":7,"Preview":{"Id":1902978,"PostDate":1440079286,"PostContent":"Our wedding is October 27th, 10 weeks from this past Tuesday.\u00a0 The resort said they would be in c...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411127203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d205552c98409dca07d32d53e34d011c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Our wedding is October 27th, 10 weeks from this past Tuesday.&amp;nbsp; The resort said they would be in contact with me to go over my details, but I haven&#039;t heard from them yet.&amp;nbsp; I have been compiling a list of questions over the past few months...and once in a while have contacted them before purchasing something to make sure it can be used.&amp;nbsp; They have always responded to my messages in a reasonable amount of time.&amp;nbsp; Just not sure if they should have contacted me already or not....trying not to panic lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Should I contact them, or wait a week and see if they contact me after the 27th of this month?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902978,"PostDate":1440079286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Our wedding is October 27th, 10 weeks from this past Tuesday.\u00a0 The resort said they would be in contact with me to go over my details, but I haven't heard from them yet.\u00a0 I have been compiling a list of questions over the past few months...and once in a while have contacted them before purchasing something to make sure it can be used.\u00a0 They have always responded to my messages in a reasonable amount of time.\u00a0 Just not sure if they should have contacted me already or not....trying not to panic lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Should I contact them, or wait a week and see if they contact me after the 27th of this month?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411127203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c866a8a84d8891b23c5e12bb9ecdcb6f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RivieraBride15\"] What resort are you booked at? Did they give a specific time frame in which they would contact you to go through your details?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s hard to say without knowing the resort as each one operates differently. I started booking my details immediately after I put down my deposit but I know many resorts that don&#039;t go through the details until 1 or 2 months before your wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Do you have a phone number to call? I always find when I&#039;m having a hard time getting an email response from the resort, calling them usually works. I&#039;m sure it will all work out! I hope you hear from them soon!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902995,"PostDate":1440090719,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279902\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279902-rivierabride15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RivieraBride15<\/span><\/a> What resort are you booked at? Did they give a specific time frame in which they would contact you to go through your details?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's hard to say without knowing the resort as each one operates differently. I started booking my details immediately after I put down my deposit but I know many resorts that don't go through the details until 1 or 2 months before your wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Do you have a phone number to call? I always find when I'm having a hard time getting an email response from the resort, calling them usually works. I'm sure it will all work out! I hope you hear from them soon!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415551111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.205.66.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f334085146c4b83ed1fe8767de0db01b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;snswedding2016 is right, it depends on the resort...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What resort are you getting married at? That is the biggest factor....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902997,"PostDate":1440091251,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>snswedding2016 is right, it depends on the resort...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What resort are you getting married at? That is the biggest factor....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shira_mei@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"104.205.66.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436990980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Shira2015","Id":283977,"Name":"Shira2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f55cb94d26996febcd1a63dbe53268e5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are getting married at the Catalonia Riviera Maya.&amp;nbsp; They said they start with the details 2-3 months before the wedding and in one of our last correspondence, they said everything has to be finalized by the end of September.&amp;nbsp; Maybe I will give them another week or two and see what happens?&amp;nbsp; I know they have lots of brides, so I dont want to be a pain :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903000,"PostDate":1440092325,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are getting married at the Catalonia Riviera Maya.\u00a0 They said they start with the details 2-3 months before the wedding and in one of our last correspondence, they said everything has to be finalized by the end of September.\u00a0 Maybe I will give them another week or two and see what happens?\u00a0 I know they have lots of brides, so I dont want to be a pain <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411127203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e13e5f4f78ea195cf9cb39ed30b10b3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@RivieraBride15&amp;nbsp; If you&#039;re at all concerned, contact them. If it&#039;s going to put your mind at ease, send a quick email and ask them. Mention that you&#039;re only 10 weeks out now and if everything is to be finalized by the end of September, when will you hear from the coordinator to get it all done. Yes - it varies with every resort and you&#039;re right, they do have lots of brides. But it&#039;s also your wedding and if all you&#039;re asking is when you&#039;ll hear from someone, you&#039;re entitled to ask!! You aren&#039;t being a pain! I would absolutely send a quick note and see what they say!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903052,"PostDate":1440170497,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@RivieraBride15\u00a0 If you're at all concerned, contact them. If it's going to put your mind at ease, send a quick email and ask them. Mention that you're only 10 weeks out now and if everything is to be finalized by the end of September, when will you hear from the coordinator to get it all done. Yes - it varies with every resort and you're right, they do have lots of brides. But it's also your wedding and if all you're asking is when you'll hear from someone, you're entitled to ask!! You aren't being a pain! I would absolutely send a quick note and see what they say!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0013b36450d3bde439296be885af203","RawContent":"My sister got married there! It was about 6-8 weeks before when she starting working with them on details. \n\nI don&#039;t think there is any harm in reaching out though. If they have a final details sheet that they&#039;ll want you to complete, you could just ask for a copy of it so you can be prepared with all your choices and questions. My resort sent me my final details sheet like 3 months in advance. I sent it back 2 months in advance but they did absolutely nothing with it until a couple weeks before anyway.\n\nMy sister loved the wedding coordinators and her wedding was beautiful so try not to worry!\n[quote name=\"RivieraBride15\" post=\"1903000\" timestamp=\"1440088725\"]\nWe are getting married at the Catalonia Riviera Maya.  They said they start with the details 2-3 months before the wedding and in one of our last correspondence, they said everything has to be finalized by the end of September.  Maybe I will give them another week or two and see what happens?  I know they have lots of brides, so I dont want to be a pain :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1903087,"PostDate":1440186564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My sister got married there! It was about 6-8 weeks before when she starting working with them on details.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I don't think there is any harm in reaching out though. If they have a final details sheet that they'll want you to complete, you could just ask for a copy of it so you can be prepared with all your choices and questions. My resort sent me my final details sheet like 3 months in advance. I sent it back 2 months in advance but they did absolutely nothing with it until a couple weeks before anyway.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My sister loved the wedding coordinators and her wedding was beautiful so try not to worry!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RivieraBride15, on 20 August 2015 - 09:38 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are getting married at the Catalonia Riviera Maya.\u00a0 They said they start with the details 2-3 months before the wedding and in one of our last correspondence, they said everything has to be finalized by the end of September.\u00a0 Maybe I will give them another week or two and see what happens?\u00a0 I know they have lots of brides, so I dont want to be a pain <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9230ef4b97e240a67f11717f4b220b8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"beckys98\"] - that&#039;s so great to hear!!! Thank you!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903190,"PostDate":1440417151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> - that's so great to hear!!! Thank you!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411127203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79510,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e368493d8aa9917aa9231d658680ad3e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;After all that worry, the hotel just emailed me :)&amp;nbsp; Let the real planning begin!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903205,"PostDate":1440432069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>After all that worry, the hotel just emailed me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Let the real planning begin!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411127203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79510","Title":"When Should I Contact The Resort Re Planning?","LastPostDate":1440432069},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
