o cute! I can't even tell you how much I love them! <br \/> <br \/> wow good job on the painting!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andcasta@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"65.100.175.243","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1201466059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208381.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Andi","Id":208381,"Name":"Andi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45109,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f445359e44011ca549296fbc1c04f3a2","RawContent":"so freaking cute love them, gotta love great friends and good beer","Attachments":[],"Id":928794,"PostDate":1258451135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                so freaking cute love them, gotta love great friends and good beer\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"march132010@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1238026800,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216144.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"march132010","Id":216144,"Name":"march132010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45109,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f85eb9e41112c40cfe8ffc9b26c90942","RawContent":"You did an awesome job! I love them and I&#039;m sure your guests will too!","Attachments":[],"Id":929032,"PostDate":1258487593,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You did an awesome job! I love them and I'm sure your guests will too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"doniejordan@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236278461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215508.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":208,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Donie Jordan","Id":215508,"Name":"Donie Jordan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45109,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d85442d9e9414fe074a2a21a857f2d9","RawContent":"Thanks for all of the sweet compliments everyone! I so love doing this kind of junk and hope it inspires someone out there &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n \n The tags are stickers on paper. I have basically gone nutso with the whole sticker thing ~ my name is Autumn and I&#039;m addicted to making stickers for my wedding. I made a .ppt template that has the circles and then I put all kinds of stuff inside, print on the full sheet of sticker paper then punch out with a 1.5&amp;quot; circle punch. I also have a 2&amp;quot; punch that looks like an ornament. Punch out a bunch of those, plop on the sticker, punch a hole at the top, attach with ribbon ~ and voila ~ instant tag! \n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;alkoch&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Autumn - I love them! I just finished mine too. We did the same technique with the holes in a piece of wood, it worked great! I freaked out because I thought I needed more and OTC isn&#039;t selling them anymore like you said. Congrats I love how you did the initials - I am not that ambitious! Mine are just solid colors- how did you do the tags are they stickers?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n \n Patti, we are getting so close! And oh my, the wedding room is getting a little out of control with all the projects. My planning thread is on the to do list so hopefully I can post it next week! It makes me so happy to hear about people having fun at Dreams. Eek I can&#039;t wait to get there!\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Patti&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;They look great, Autumn. Good job. I hope you post all of your DYI stuff before you head off to the wedding. BTW, my daughter got married in PV and we all stayed at Dreams. Had a blast.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":929112,"PostDate":1258492204,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for all of the sweet compliments everyone! I so love doing this kind of junk and hope it inspires someone out there <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> The tags are stickers on paper. I have basically gone nutso with the whole sticker thing ~ my name is Autumn and I'm addicted to making stickers for my wedding. I made a .ppt template that has the circles and then I put all kinds of stuff inside, print on the full sheet of sticker paper then punch out with a 1.5\" circle punch. I also have a 2\" punch that looks like an ornament. Punch out a bunch of those, plop on the sticker, punch a hole at the top, attach with ribbon ~ and voila ~ instant tag! <br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>alkoch<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Autumn - I love them! I just finished mine too. We did the same technique with the holes in a piece of wood, it worked great! I freaked out because I thought I needed more and OTC isn't selling them anymore like you said. Congrats I love how you did the initials - I am not that ambitious! Mine are just solid colors- how did you do the tags are they stickers?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> <br \/> Patti, we are getting so close! And oh my, the wedding room is getting a little out of control with all the projects. My planning thread is on the to do list so hopefully I can post it next week! It makes me so happy to hear about people having fun at Dreams. Eek I can't wait to get there!<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Patti<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">They look great, Autumn. Good job. I hope you post all of your DYI stuff before you head off to the wedding. BTW, my daughter got married in PV and we all stayed at Dreams. Had a blast.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"afischbeck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.112.22.70","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1239936566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216783.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"autjo","Id":216783,"Name":"autjo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45109,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4331d5cccca0f02a6ba0a2b72980a0be","RawContent":"Autumn, I wish I would have read this before I made my wedding logo oval. If it were round the sticker thing would be easier for me i think. hmmm\n \n Do you think there is a way to easily get my logos onto stickers? wow, i am really green when it comes to the DIY projects. You are unbelievable. So, you are giving 2 maracas to each guest right? Adorable! \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i59.photobucket.com\/albums\/g315\/nicitica\/nicloejasinlogo2-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":929123,"PostDate":1258492927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Autumn, I wish I would have read this before I made my wedding logo oval. If it were round the sticker thing would be easier for me i think. hmmm<br \/> <br \/> Do you think there is a way to easily get my logos onto stickers? wow, i am really green when it comes to the DIY projects. You are unbelievable. So, you are giving 2 maracas to each guest right? Adorable! <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i59.photobucket.com\/albums\/g315\/nicitica\/nicloejasinlogo2-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Akumal, Mexico 05.29.10<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jasinandnicole@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253405582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221799.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicitica","Id":221799,"Name":"nicitica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45109,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69d4df32fd9461450890599648a4570a","RawContent":"Aut- you are quite the DIY queen, I could never paint so well! gooooood job!!","Attachments":[],"Id":929128,"PostDate":1258493055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Aut- you are quite the DIY queen, I could never paint so well! gooooood job!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erika.holler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.177.241.195","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1224483780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212330.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":79,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Erika J","Id":212330,"Name":"Erika J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45109,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c67a37776afb3eb52fa6391535c124f","RawContent":"Dude! I&#039;m not the one who made a million cranes!\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Erika J&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Aut- you are quite the DIY queen, I could never paint so well! gooooood job!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Nicole ~ Your logo with the lime is so frickin cute! You can def make stickers out of it. Fiskars makes oval punches. Or you could print them and then cut them as squares. PM me if you want some help :)\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;nicitica&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Autumn, I wish I would have read this before I made my wedding logo oval. If it were round the sticker thing would be easier for me i think. hmmm\n \n Do you think there is a way to easily get my logos onto stickers? wow, i am really green when it comes to the DIY projects. You are unbelievable. So, you are giving 2 maracas to each guest right? Adorable! \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i59.photobucket.com\/albums\/g315\/nicitica\/nicloejasinlogo2-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":929226,"PostDate":1258495556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Dude! I'm not the one who made a million cranes!<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Erika J<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Aut- you are quite the DIY queen, I could never paint so well! gooooood job!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Nicole ~ Your logo with the lime is so frickin cute! You can def make stickers out of it. Fiskars makes oval punches. Or you could print them and then cut them as squares. PM me if you want some help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>nicitica<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Autumn, I wish I would have read this before I made my wedding logo oval. If it were round the sticker thing would be easier for me i think. hmmm<br \/> <br \/> Do you think there is a way to easily get my logos onto stickers? wow, i am really green when it comes to the DIY projects. You are unbelievable. So, you are giving 2 maracas to each guest right? Adorable! <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i59.photobucket.com\/albums\/g315\/nicitica\/nicloejasinlogo2-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"afischbeck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.112.22.70","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1239936566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216783.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"autjo","Id":216783,"Name":"autjo","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":59,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
