{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":17373,"Author":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1429785252,"Content":"<p>Hi Ann,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can you send me your wedding info:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You and groom full name<\/p>\n<p>wedding resort<\/p>\n<p>date and room category staying<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would love to send a thank you gift it the resort allows it.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"8fef61e2835bad813d4a0967079a335f","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17416,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1429914494,"Content":"<p>Hi Tammy,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for your note! That's such a kind offer! Our vow renewal is scheduled for our 4th anniversary this October 20th. We're having our ceremony at Grand Coral Beach Club and Joyce from Dream Weddings is helping me out with everything. We only have a couple of people going with us so a resort didn't work out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're planning on Azul Fives but those plans aren't firmed up just yet. We didn't qualify for a group rate since we didn't have the numbers so our travel agent is just watching the pricing for us and we'll likely book next month or early in June. We're hoping the pricing will allow us a one bedroom suite but we're just in a holding pattern right now.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks again.<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"c0378296d010c0dc11f450cabd53aa05","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17418,"Author":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1429916269,"Content":"<p>Hi Ann,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is your TA a karisma GIVC so she can get an upgrade? I know I can offer my clients the WOW upgrade and it goes from deluxe to one bedroom sky suite so check with her...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>obviously I can't get an upgrade for another agents booking but I can send something to your room so when you have all your details, let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n","PostKey":"a21a74e1bb3fd2773849376c3bfeb69b","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17419,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1429920761,"Content":"<p>Hi Tammy,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just curious - how can we have an upgrade if we aren't having our ceremony there? I tried to get something at Azul Fives and the system let me book the site I wanted but then a couple of weeks later they said it wasn't available. I just walked away from the deposit. I didn't want where they tried to put us so I opted to go off site. Joyce has been fantastic so I just gave her all the business. I still love the resort. I'm just waiting to find out if they have deluxe rooms with king beds.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would love nothing more than to find a way to put the business through you. You've been so great!\u00a0 But we have rewards certificates that we're using, and I thought being in Canada that you couldn't help us?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"9509e453877bebe40402ac812dca4775","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17420,"Author":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1429920972,"Content":"<p>usually the deluxe rooms are 2 beds and one bedrooms are king bed.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>no, i don't want to take the business from your agent, but would like to send you something for all your help on the site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you give me your booking info when you have it, I can order something from the concierge to be sent to your room but need a minimum of 2 weeks notice before you arrive in mexico because they can sometimes take a long time.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"0ae3860070a64d9d5553335c771e5df4","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17421,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1429924180,"Content":"<p>That's really nice Tammy. Thank you. And I will say no thanks is necessary. The girls here are great. I love watching them get ready for this special time in their lives, and after everything Doug and I have been through, even just to get married, it's sweet to be just a small part of it.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"bac4a32e87d86c4ed2cb318368ea58a9","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19652,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1438519055,"Content":"Hi Tammy. Hope all is well. We are finally booked for our renewal!<br><br>\nWe have chosen Valentin Imperial Maya Resort. It was adults only that won out in the end along with a good price. We have chosen the Silver Partial Oceanview room and our TA is trying to get an upgrade for us as well. One of the other brides here highly recommended it and so did our TA. As well the rooms are gorgeous for getting ready photos. We are booked to arrive on Sunday October 18th at 3:35 pm. My husband's name is Douglas Hoogeveen. Our renewal is still with Joyce and Grand Coral Beach Club and we are going from there into Playa del Carmen to a restaurant that Joyce recommended. After everything we've been through I'm really looking forward to this!<br><br>\nAnn","PostKey":"20c37edd38fa5a88f41eddee1692bee5","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
