{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"4c411f4ea12aef3dc724056a6d5750af","RawContent":"I personally like them\n\nBoth. I&#039;m not sure your color scheme to say which one I like best based on that. Of the two I like the hints of white better as it feels more bright, like the tropics. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899817,"PostDate":1436112663,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I personally like them<br>\nBoth. I'm not sure your color scheme to say which one I like best based on that. Of the two I like the hints of white better as it feels more bright, like the tropics. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e99fa7129c36895c7a33d338dfc683d3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"maybeoneday\" post=\"1899816\" timestamp=\"1436121611\"]\nYour family are not far at all!\n\nI cant decide on the Flowers:\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=32942\"]Shades-of-Red-Bridal-Bouquet.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=32943\"]OO4bs6Hg_medium.jpg[\/url]\n\nWhat do you think? X\n\nMaybeoneday\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico[\/quote]\nOh I LOVE the second one!! Looks very tropical!! I&#039;m not partial to red but that&#039;s just my own personal preference. What&#039;s important is what YOU like!! (But I still like the second one lol)","Attachments":[],"Id":1899819,"PostDate":1436124958,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>maybeoneday, on 05 July 2015 - 02:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Your family are not far at all!<br><br>\nI cant decide on the Flowers:<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=32942' class='bbc_url' title=''>Shades-of-Red-Bridal-Bouquet.jpg<\/a><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=32943' class='bbc_url' title=''>OO4bs6Hg_medium.jpg<\/a><br><br>\nWhat do you think? X<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh I LOVE the second one!! Looks very tropical!! I'm not partial to red but that's just my own personal preference. What's important is what YOU like!! (But I still like the second one lol)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"94787175704553e83c5e46f15f6730c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] I think the starfishes look very good! I think they&#039;ll look great when attached to the chairs :), can&#039;t wait to see it all together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"maybeoneday\"] I like the second ones more&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899823,"PostDate":1436135391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> I think the starfishes look very good! I think they'll look great when attached to the chairs <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>, can't wait to see it all together.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281816\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281816-maybeoneday\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maybeoneday<\/span><\/a> I like the second ones more\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"23c165a0fd4dc84a2dab150d5c3b97d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ah! I thought I was following your thread! How could I not be!? Crazy! Any ways, I&#039;m updated on it all now since the last time&amp;nbsp;I read through. I love the starfish craft you did! It gives me some great ideas. I&#039;m going to start making my chair hangers this weekend\/ next week, and I was just thinking of hot glue gunning them to my tassle things but the broach seems like a great idea! And like I&#039;ve said before, I&#039;m so happy you got your dress! Its absolutely gorgeous!!! The keyhole back is absolutely amazing. I had considered doing a dress like that but I didnt like the idea of straps. I think you will look stunning on your special day! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900168,"PostDate":1436532466,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Ah! I thought I was following your thread! How could I not be!? Crazy! Any ways, I'm updated on it all now since the last time\u00a0I read through. I love the starfish craft you did! It gives me some great ideas. I'm going to start making my chair hangers this weekend\/ next week, and I was just thinking of hot glue gunning them to my tassle things but the broach seems like a great idea! And like I've said before, I'm so happy you got your dress! Its absolutely gorgeous!!! The keyhole back is absolutely amazing. I had considered doing a dress like that but I didnt like the idea of straps. I think you will look stunning on your special day! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432086904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1436540030,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cfafeb3caa186527e963a77cc53d080","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@TinkerSofi&amp;nbsp; @yycbride2016&amp;nbsp; Thank you both of you. I&#039;m anxious to see how they turn out. I&#039;m thinking fuchsia chair bows and turquoise table runner. @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] has been a huge help with my colours. I just think Doug won&#039;t like pink on the table so I think it&#039;s the only way to go. But I don&#039;t want to overdo the colour.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900176,"PostDate":1436538009,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@TinkerSofi\u00a0 @yycbride2016\u00a0 Thank you both of you. I'm anxious to see how they turn out. I'm thinking fuchsia chair bows and turquoise table runner. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> has been a huge help with my colours. I just think Doug won't like pink on the table so I think it's the only way to go. But I don't want to overdo the colour.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"243c707934fa3aad54d83a93adc35aec","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1900176\" timestamp=\"1436552409\"]\n@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]  @[member=\"yycbride2016\"]  Thank you both of you. I&#039;m anxious to see how they turn out. I&#039;m thinking fuchsia chair bows and turquoise table runner. @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] has been a huge help with my colours. I just think Doug won&#039;t like pink on the table so I think it&#039;s the only way to go. But I don&#039;t want to overdo the colour.[\/quote]I still think that&#039;s not overdoing it heheh\nIf you have colored napkins and linens and plates and cups etc you may do that. But it would be quite similar to Rachel&#039;s which I personally thought was genius.   I&#039;m a little\njealous really hehe. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1900197,"PostDate":1436560402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 10 July 2015 - 02:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a>  @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283167\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283167-yycbride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">yycbride2016<\/span><\/a>  Thank you both of you. I'm anxious to see how they turn out. I'm thinking fuchsia chair bows and turquoise table runner. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> has been a huge help with my colours. I just think Doug won't like pink on the table so I think it's the only way to go. But I don't want to overdo the colour.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI still think that's not overdoing it heheh<br>\nIf you have colored napkins and linens and plates and cups etc you may do that. But it would be quite similar to Rachel's which I personally thought was genius.   I'm a little<br>\njealous really hehe. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d755844dfaf255a929deb9cbad067a6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I went to the dentist tonight and walked out of the dentist&#039;s office..... and into David&#039;s Bridal! Not a good move.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I bought a veil and shoes! lol&amp;nbsp; The veil is perfect!! It has a bit of sparkle on it that I think is going to perfectly match my dress. They call it a starburst. I think&amp;nbsp; I need to take it back to be shortened though cuz it&#039;s a bit longer than what I wanted. I think. Yeah I&#039;m sure. At least I think I&#039;m sure. Am I??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The shoes worked out great, but I&#039;m still going to get the Adrianna Papell&#039;s since I love them so much and the colour I can wear again anyway. They aren&#039;t over dressy that I couldn&#039;t manage them for work, and even in Mexico if we do one of the nicer a la carte restaurants one night I can wear them for that. Right? I already said.... I&#039;m a total shoe slut so one more pair is only going to make my life easier!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The shoes are being dyed Horizon (royal blue).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900203,"PostDate":1436569014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I went to the dentist tonight and walked out of the dentist's office..... and into David's Bridal! Not a good move.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I bought a veil and shoes! lol\u00a0 The veil is perfect!! It has a bit of sparkle on it that I think is going to perfectly match my dress. They call it a starburst. I think\u00a0 I need to take it back to be shortened though cuz it's a bit longer than what I wanted. I think. Yeah I'm sure. At least I think I'm sure. Am I??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The shoes worked out great, but I'm still going to get the Adrianna Papell's since I love them so much and the colour I can wear again anyway. They aren't over dressy that I couldn't manage them for work, and even in Mexico if we do one of the nicer a la carte restaurants one night I can wear them for that. Right? I already said.... I'm a total shoe slut so one more pair is only going to make my life easier!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The shoes are being dyed Horizon (royal blue).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1900203]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-232000-0-39666100-1436583237.jpg\" title=\"shoes.jpg -  11.48KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-232000-0-39666100-1436583237.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"shoes.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1900203]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-232000-0-39338400-1436582639.png\" title=\"veil.png -  301.85KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-232000-0-39338400-1436582639.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"veil.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"3164aea04b4d75e55e9814579672c464","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great choices! &amp;nbsp;Love the sparkle on the veil!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see your shoes once they are dyed.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900204,"PostDate":1436571887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great choices! \u00a0Love the sparkle on the veil!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see your shoes once they are dyed.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1436628993,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"182a8c19ed9fb2fc07351c89b93a2745","RawContent":"Yeah me too. They charge you 5 bucks for it and she is telling me that there is a spray you can buy at a shoe repair type place that will waterproof dyed shoes so that the colour doesn&#039;t run. Plus my foot slides around a bit and they told me I can get petals to put inside the shoes so that doesn&#039;t happen. Geez..... I just finished saying yesterday - you really do learn something new every day!","Attachments":[],"Id":1900212,"PostDate":1436575815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yeah me too. They charge you 5 bucks for it and she is telling me that there is a spray you can buy at a shoe repair type place that will waterproof dyed shoes so that the colour doesn't run. Plus my foot slides around a bit and they told me I can get petals to put inside the shoes so that doesn't happen. Geez..... I just finished saying yesterday - you really do learn something new every day!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"eb9f6161f5b2dfe74a6cc26afd3b745b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Those shoes look so comfy! I&#039;d definitely get the petals. If nothing else, they&#039;ll at least provide some extra cushioning to the balls of your feet, that&#039;s always a plus for me! haha. I got some for my shoes and I&#039;m glad I did. As my foot starts sweating, it keeps going forward and it becomes quite uncomfortable, but not with the petals :).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love the veil. I was totally the \"no veil\" kind of girl when this whole planning thing started, but now I love them and I love the look of them on people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I agree with&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] that I don&#039;t think you&#039;d overdo it with the colors if you have the chairs in pink and blue runners on the tables. On the contrary, I think it would look nice and colorful, rather than monochromatic (if you were to have only one or the other). If you were to have the napkins and plates, etc. in different colors, yes, but not the way you&#039;re thinking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900220,"PostDate":1436620435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Those shoes look so comfy! I'd definitely get the petals. If nothing else, they'll at least provide some extra cushioning to the balls of your feet, that's always a plus for me! haha. I got some for my shoes and I'm glad I did. As my foot starts sweating, it keeps going forward and it becomes quite uncomfortable, but not with the petals <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the veil. I was totally the \"no veil\" kind of girl when this whole planning thing started, but now I love them and I love the look of them on people.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree with\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> that I don't think you'd overdo it with the colors if you have the chairs in pink and blue runners on the tables. On the contrary, I think it would look nice and colorful, rather than monochromatic (if you were to have only one or the other). If you were to have the napkins and plates, etc. in different colors, yes, but not the way you're thinking.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":404,"TotalPages":41,"CurrentPage":140,"NextPage":150,"PreviousPage":130,"LastPage":400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
