/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.80.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1440813874,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33b94961f5eb0d8e086d9d1f20239ddc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Vegas is definitely on my bucket list!!\n\n\nLadies - I have to tell you! I found a song tonight that made me tear up. You have to listen to it!! It&#039;s called When I Say I Do by Matthew West. I think this song just might dump the others and I&#039;ll just have to find another spot to play them.\n\n\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903719,"PostDate":1440808433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Vegas is definitely on my bucket list!!<br><br>\nLadies - I have to tell you! I found a song tonight that made me tear up. You have to listen to it!! It's called When I Say I Do by Matthew West. I think this song just might dump the others and I'll just have to find another spot to play them.<br><br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":404,"TotalPages":41,"CurrentPage":280,"NextPage":290,"PreviousPage":270,"LastPage":400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
